  "details": "# Issue:\n\nRight now the system is called \"Avatar Height\" in the Action Menu and in the Menu it's also just called \"Height\". This description is not correct however, as it actually describes the Avatar View Height and not just the height in a way you would normally measure it.\n\n# Suggesion:  \n\nRename it to View Height / Avatar View Height everywhere as this would make it more consistent and would better describe what number it's actually showing / changing.\n\nPlaces where it would need to be changed:\n\n- Main Menu Avatars Tab  \n\n- Main Menu Avatar Details  \n\n- Action Menu Quick Actions  \n\n- QM User Profile Match Eye Height (Match View Height)",
